      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠣᠷᠮᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>qormayilaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хормойлох</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XORMAILA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and i. To put or carry something in the skirt of one's garment; to walk along the foot of a mountain.</definition>
      <page>968</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
      <dico>Kowalewski</dico>
      <unicode>ᠬᠣᠷᠮᠠᠶᠢᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
      <definition>mettre qc, dans le pan, porter qc, dans le pan de son habit; 2 marcher le long du pied de la montagne</definition>
      <page>971</page>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
